# Origin lock (only Cloudflare may reach this host): disabled.
#
# Since about 2026-09-30 the host rewrites the client address of requests
# coming through Cloudflare to the visitor's IP, so "Require ip" with
# Cloudflare's ranges rejected every visitor. Matching on CONN_REMOTE_ADDR
# (as suggested by the host) rejected every visitor as well. Until a working
# way is found, the site is reachable without the lock, as it was since the
# outage. History: git log -- public/.htaccess

# The FTP deploy keeps its sync state next to the files. It lists every
# uploaded file with a hash; nobody needs to download it.
<Files ".ftp-deploy-sync-state.json">
  Require all denied
</Files>
